{"about_the_game":"You just got hired at the biggest game studio out there... can you make it all the way up the corporate ladder? Build your deck of skills, discover powerful talent synergies, battle workplace challenges, manage your sanity, and crush the industry! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1098610/extras/46554e84f75f578ae8b05355ec25cbd5.poster.avif?t=1762466509\" width=616 height=233 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1098610/extras/46554e84f75f578ae8b05355ec25cbd5.webm?t=1762466509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Build Your Deck</strong>: <strong>Over 200 skills &amp; talents</strong> with an ever-changing schedule ensures that <strong>every career run will be unique</strong>!  <br></li><li><strong>Challenging Progression</strong>: Test your limits in Hard Mode and traverse the <strong>9 Circles of Corporate Hell</strong>! <br></li><li><strong>Unlocked Potential</strong>: Unlock new characters, skills, talents, bosses, and difficulty levels as you achieve milestones.   </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1098610/extras/47d575ca5af80139b36100f619579f8c.poster.avif?t=1762466509\" width=615 height=56 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1098610/extras/47d575ca5af80139b36100f619579f8c.webm?t=1762466509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Innovative Mechanics</strong>: The <strong>rolling health</strong> system will keep you on your toes while your <strong>sanity</strong> may result in unpredictable effects. <strong>Cycling</strong> allows you to strategically draw new skills and prepare satisfying combos.    </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1098610/extras/1b13decd90605843473cc0aabe3f8be3.avif?t=1762466509\" width=616 height=215 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Playstyle Options</strong>: A charming and motley cast of playable characters awaits you. Whether you want to take your time carefully planning or play in the fast lane, you've got options.  <br></li><li><strong>Strange Company</strong>: <strong>Over 40 unique battle encounters</strong> include everything from toxic players and game designer moles to creative cultists and grotesque meeting blobs!</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"231b1e6a64ba4f8ca1020cf976cb6dfe068e81c0.jpg","localized_name":"Jack","name":"Jack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1098610/231b1e6a64ba4f8ca1020cf976cb6dfe068e81c0.jpg"},{"icon":"14f774f18e02eb65fa9ac25bcc1a7d45f952ce76.jpg","localized_name":"FIRED!","name":"FIRED!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1098610/14f774f18e02eb65fa9ac25bcc1a7d45f952ce76.jpg"},{"icon":"ef5376be6ed311b53764a948b5594b89406469f4.jpg","localized_name":"Queen","name":"Queen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1098610/ef5376be6ed311b53764a948b5594b89406469f4.jpg"},{"icon":"72da341d19d1cae3f335f8437aca764ccbb07a20.jpg","localized_name":"King","name":"King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1098610/72da341d19d1cae3f335f8437aca764ccbb07a20.jpg"},{"icon":"81cfd3d58a5b537f2bf056d82d768c20cf32be37.jpg","localized_name":"Ackshully...","name":"Ackshully...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1098610/81cfd3d58a5b537f2bf056d82d768c20cf32be37.jpg"},{"icon":"c4420bf773f90dd6afb84380b769367e04a6dbe8.jpg","localized_name":